  CardPages:
  - Hello. I am Jules Seleucid. Heiress of my line and, secretly, an agent of the
    crown! I monitor the mood of the elite.
  - Wait. You're the queen now. No need to worry about secrets!
  - I came to you with a personal request. Could you please not tell my parents about
    it?
  - However, I no longer had a choice.
  - My heart has chosen someone my family rejects. Besides my parents, only the crown
    can approve of our union!
  Card_name: Jules Seleucid
  LeftChoice:
    text: Who is the chosen one?
    effects:
